To run the Federal Emergency Management Agency (FEMA) Wave Height 
Analysis for Flood Insurance Study (WHAFIS) program, Version 3.0, 
create an input file using whatever editor is available on the 
personal computer being used, then at the command prompt, type:   

         > WHAFIS3 filename.in filename.out


A marshgrass data file (mg.dat)is included with the WHAFIS program.  
This file must be accessible to the program even if the marshgrass
option is not being used.  The output filename must not be the same 
as any existing filename or scratch files will be created; if scratch
files are created, they must be deleted prior to running the program.
                                   
